  "text": "Thank you all for sharing these critical pieces of information. Let me make sure I understand the full picture before we settle on a plan. Alex, the repair agreement you described — 30 days no co-leading or one-to-one meetings, all communication through the program coordinator, and separate weekly check-ins for four weeks — directly impacts our ability to have you and Priya co-lead the next session. Marcus, the HR policy requirement for two facilitators and a documented risk plan when a group exceeds 10 participants and a facilitator has been involved in a conduct-related dispute is clearly triggered here with 12 participants. And Mira, your commitment to serve as interim facilitator for six weeks fills a critical gap. I also want to note that Alex mentioned the repair agreement hasn't been sent to my office yet — I'll need a copy of that agreement to properly document facilitation arrangements and participant safeguards before the next session plan is published. Before I formalize a settlement, does anyone have additional information or concerns I should be aware of? I want to make sure we have everything on the table."
}
